WEBVTT

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:23.328
I think it's best
if he speaks to him alone.

00:00:57.488 --> 00:00:59.364
GRINDELWALD:
Is he frightened of me still?

00:01:00.866 --> 00:01:02.534
You need to be careful.

00:01:03.536 --> 00:01:05.745
He's not sure he made the right choice.

00:01:07.164 --> 00:01:10.166
<i>Be very gentle with him.</i>

00:01:15.673 --> 00:01:17.674
I have a gift for you, my boy.

00:01:30.104 --> 00:01:31.521
DUMBLEDORE: Is it true?

00:01:32.481 --> 00:01:33.690
About Leta?

00:01:35.234 --> 00:01:36.234
Yes.

00:01:38.988 --> 00:01:40.572
I'm so sorry.

00:01:47.246 --> 00:01:49.414
It's a blood pact, isn't it?

00:01:52.376 --> 00:01:54.461
You swore not to fight each other.

00:02:01.844 --> 00:02:05.138
How in the name of Merlin
did you manage to get...

00:02:06.974 --> 00:02:08.099
(CHUCKLES)

00:02:08.684 --> 00:02:10.518
Grindelwald doesn't seem to understand

00:02:10.603 --> 00:02:13.104
the nature of the things
he considers simple.

00:02:29.205 --> 00:02:30.538
Can you destroy it?

00:02:30.706 --> 00:02:31.956
Maybe.

00:02:34.084 --> 00:02:35.335
Maybe.

00:02:41.509 --> 00:02:43.384
Would he like a cup of tea?

00:02:44.386 --> 00:02:45.804
He'll have some milk.

00:02:48.224 --> 00:02:49.974
Hide the teaspoons.

00:02:52.353 --> 00:02:53.770
(GRUNTING)

00:02:55.898 --> 00:03:00.777
GRINDELWALD: You have suffered
<i>the most heinous of betrayals,</i>

00:03:01.987 --> 00:03:05.907
most purposely bestowed upon you
by your own blood.

00:03:05.991 --> 00:03:08.201
Your own flesh and blood.

00:03:09.036 --> 00:03:11.955
And just as
he has celebrated your torment,

00:03:14.208 --> 00:03:18.044
your brother seeks to destroy you.

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:28.137
(CHIRPING)

00:03:39.024 --> 00:03:42.652
There is a legend in your family
that a phoenix will come to any member

00:03:42.862 --> 00:03:44.571
who is in dire need.

00:03:48.242 --> 00:03:49.826
(SCREECHING)

00:03:52.162 --> 00:03:54.455
It is your birthright, my boy.

00:03:58.752 --> 00:03:59.919
As is

00:04:01.547 --> 00:04:03.965
the name I now restore to you.

00:04:06.719 --> 00:04:08.136
Aurelius.

00:04:09.597 --> 00:04:12.390
Aurelius Dumbledore.

00:04:14.101 --> 00:04:18.938
We will go down in history together
as we remake this world.

00:13:14.141 --> 00:13:15.141
English - SDH

